Haproven ek digital networking aur personal branding platform hai, jo HaproID aur digital profile cards ki services provide karta hai.
Haproven Ki Key Features
 * HaproID Profiles: Users ko ek customizable digital identity profile milti hai, jisme portfolio, social links, work experience, aur bio add kar sakte hain.
 * Digital Profile Card & CV: Isme QR code wala digital profile card aur link-enabled interactive resume/CV banane ka option hota hai.
 * Easy Sharing: Aashani se apne portfolio ya profile link ko kisi bhi client, recruiter, ya social network par share kiya ja sakta hai.
 * No Code Setup: Bina kisi coding ya website hosting setup ke quick profile ready ho jati hai.
